      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The 1924 Fawn Lodge, now closed, remains the town’s main landmark and was once a gathering spot for artists and filmmakers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
